@startuml saga-status
title Deconfliction saga status (sagas.status)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans

[*] --> started : alert.proximity\n(no running saga\nfor these hives)

started --> command_sent : engine: safe point planned,\nmove command accepted\nby Communication Control
command_sent --> moving : hive.moved\n(command delivered)
command_sent --> completed : hive.telemetry,\nhives apart
moving --> completed : hive.telemetry,\nhives apart\n(> SEPARATION_M)

command_sent --> compensating : deadline expired
moving --> compensating : deadline expired

state "next attempt\nor fail" as next <<choice>>
compensating --> next : return command accepted,\nor deadline expired
started --> next : deadline expired,\nor no safe point

next --> started : attempt 1:\nplan B, move the other hive
next --> failed : attempt 2:\noperator must act

completed --> [*]
failed --> [*]

note right of compensating
  Compensating action: the moved
  hive is sent back to the position
  it had before the command.
end note

note left of started
  Every transition is journaled in
  saga_steps and published as saga.*
  through the transactional outbox.
end note
@enduml
